  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Fix #104: Display correct protocol name in logs by @kevwan in https://github.com/kevwan/tproxy/pull/158\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/olekukonko/tablewriter from 1.0.8 to 1.0.9 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kevwan/tproxy/pull/141\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/eclipse/paho.mqtt.golang from 1.5.0 to 1.5.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kevwan/tproxy/pull/147\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/olekukonko/tablewriter from 1.0.9 to 1.1.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kevwan/tproxy/pull/148\r\n* chore(deps): bump google.golang.org/protobuf from 1.36.6 to 1.36.10 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kevwan/tproxy/pull/149\r\n* chore(deps): bump golang.org/x/net from 0.42.0 to 0.46.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kevwan/tproxy/pull/151\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/olekukonko/tablewriter from 1.1.0 to 1.1.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kevwan/tproxy/pull/153\r\n* chore(deps): bump golang.org/x/net from 0.46.0 to 0.47.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kevwan/tproxy/pull/154\r\n* chore(deps): bump go.mongodb.org/mongo-driver from 1.17.4 to 1.17.6 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kevwan/tproxy/pull/152\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/olekukonko/tablewriter from 1.1.1 to 1.1.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kevwan/tproxy/pull/155\r\n* chore(deps): bump golang.org/x/net from 0.47.0 to 0.48.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kevwan/tproxy/pull/156\r\n* chore(deps): bump google.golang.org/protobuf from 1.36.10 to 1.36.11 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kevwan/tproxy/pull/157\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kevwan/tproxy/compare/v0.9.1...v0.9.2",
